103
00:08:48,910 --> 00:08:49,530
Let's begin.

104
00:08:50,250 --> 00:08:52,250
Task Achievement Band 5.

105
00:08:53,050 --> 00:08:58,330
Generally addresses the task the format may be inappropriate in places.

106
00:08:59,250 --> 00:09:03,030
