00:13:49,220 --> 00:13:54,920
Presents a relevant position, although the conclusions may become unclear or repetitive.

170
00:13:55,800 --> 00:14:01,360
Presents relevant main ideas, but some may be inadequately developed or unclear.

171
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:03,440
And here is the question.

172
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:06,420
Choose all the correct answers.

173
00:14:07,380 --> 00:14:12,240
What are the main differences between band 5 and band 6 in

174
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:14,280
