196
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:14,260
Option B also illustrates the difference between these two bands.

197
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:20,560
At band 6, main ideas are developed more fully, not complete, but

198
00:15:20,560 --> 00:15:22,800
certainly deeper than band 5.

199
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:28,140
However, option C should not include the phrase band 6.

200
00:15:28,940 --> 00:15:33,580
In band 5, it is clearly stated that there may be irrelevant

