202
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:42,280
But in band 6, this error no longer exists.

203
00:15:42,730 --> 00:15:44,800
D is also incorrect.

204
00:15:45,460 --> 00:15:49,040
At band 5, the writer already expresses a position.

205
00:15:49,700 --> 00:15:52,920
It's just that the development is not always clear.

206
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:57,560
Of course, at band 6, the development must be clear.

