00:16:00,740 --> 00:16:05,600
At band 6, all ideas are summarized and restated with a conclusion.

209
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:09,980
At band 5, there may be no conclusions drawn.

210
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:13,180
F is incorrect.

211
00:16:13,980 --> 00:16:17,020
Band 5 includes development for the ideas.

212
00:16:17,460 --> 00:16:18,900
It's just not always clear.

213
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:25,400
So, we've completed the criterion about content differentiating clearly between

214
00:16:25,400 --> 00:16:27,420
band 5 and band 6.

215
00:16:28,140 --> 00:16:32,760
Let's move on to the next criterion, coherence and cohesion.

216
00:16:34,280 --> 00:16:35,960
Coherence and cohesion.

217
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:43,180
Band 5 presents information with some organization but there may be a

218
00:16:43,180 --> 00:16:45,040
